  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　りょうりに　つかう\nしょくざいの　いっしゅ。てきとうに　つんだ\nハーブが　かおり　いろどりを　ついかする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프 요리에 사용되는\n식재료 중 하나. 알맞게 딴\n허브가 향과 색감을 더해준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作露營料理時使用的食材之一。\n隨手摘取的香草能夠為料理\n增添香氣和色彩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient de cuisine pour le camping.\nCette racine permet d’ajouter du parfum\net de la couleur aux plats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Zutat für PokéCamping-Mahlzeiten. Dieses wahllos\ngepflückte Kraut verleiht Speisen ein spezielles Aroma\nund eine kräftige Farbe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Unas\nhierbas que aportan color y aroma a la salsa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno degli ingredienti che puoi usare per cucinare\nin campeggio. Queste erbe selezionate con grande\ncura aggiungono a ogni pietanza un aroma unico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the many ingredients that can be used for\ncooking at your camp. Though carelessly picked, these\nherbs can add a fragrant accent to a dish.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　料理に　使う\n食材の　一種。適当に　摘んだ\nハーブが　香り　彩りを　追加する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露营营地制作料理时会使用的\n一种食材。将信手摘取的香草\n点缀在上面，使料理更加色香味俱全。",
